  "task": {
    "objective": "Two controlled hunters seek a capture; the controlled evader seeks an explicit gate escape after tick eight. Scans exchange energy and concealment for imperfect persistent contacts.",
    "natural_termination": "Explicit hunter tag within Manhattan one after movement causes capture; otherwise explicit evader action at open gate causes escape. Capture takes precedence if simultaneous. H=48 is only truncation, not evader victory.",
    "interaction": "Costly scans reveal the scanner current position for two ticks while obtaining nearest radius-five echo; a physical decoy can replace the true contact. A relay copies contact information to the teammate without refreshing age. Movement, cloak, decoys and explicit capture alter interception opportunities.",
